ica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英特尔发布GPU D系列加速卡，最高支持480GB显存专攻万亿参数推理</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亚马逊开源TorchNeuron工具，实现PyTorch代码在Trainium芯片上无缝运行</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI紧急启动300亿美元融资，估值目标直指1.4万亿美元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌开源递归自我改进框架Harness²，无需修改模型权重即可提升性能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式开源递归自我改进（RSI）框架Harness²，该方案无需修改大模型底座权重，通过优化外围运行脚手架（Scaffold）实现性能提升。Harness²引入双层递归架构：任务级递归通过提议-探测-合成机制在开放场景下验证改动；改进级递归则将调试经验沉淀至库中，供Agent检索复用。实测显示，接入Harness²后，GLM-5在WorkBuddy-Bench测试中得分提升11.5分，性能反超原生Gemini 3.5 Flash，并在JobBench及法律基准LAB等领域表现显著。该框架标志着AI从单纯依赖Scaling Law转向Runtime认知工程，支持Agent在运行中自我感知与修补，为开发者提供了一种低成本实现模型持续进化的新路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁百灵开源Ming-3.0语音系列，五款模型覆盖合成理解与识别</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/434c3214b4f77112934589f5f35e124a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁百灵于10月20日正式开源Ming-3.0语音系列，包含Ming-3.0-tts（0.5B、tiny）、Ming-3.0-audio（flash、tiny）与Ming-3.0-asr-tiny共五款模型，权重已上架Hugging Face与ModelScope。该系列覆盖语音合成、音频理解与对话、语音识别三大任务。合成方向支持Voice Design音色定制及导演模式，可精细控制情绪与副语言标签；理解方向采用6.25Hz低帧率音频表征，结合KDA与Gated MLA混合注意力及稀疏MoE架构，实现长音频结构化分析；识别方向引入Context ASR，支持热词与上下文辅助判断。实测显示，Ming-3.0-tts-0.5B在Controlled Voice评测中以1069 Elo位列开放权重模型第一；Ming-</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英特尔发布GPU D系列加速卡，最高支持480GB显存专攻万亿参数推理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/653006262d8058c048ab4344d0e44641.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英特尔在OCP全球峰会上正式发布面向AI推理领域的GPU D系列（代号Crescent Island，型号D270）。该系列基于Xe3P架构，专为长上下文处理与多路并发推理设计。核心规格方面，D系列最高支持480GB LPDDR5X显存，显存带宽达1.5TB/s，FP8精度下算力输出为1.3PFLOPS，整卡功耗控制在350W。英特尔表示，单卡可承载3000亿参数模型，八卡系统可运行超1万亿参数模型。通过采用标准PCIe形态与风冷散热设计，该产品无需液冷改造即可部署，降低了企业数据中心的应用门槛。选用LPDDR5X旨在提升能效比并实现超大容量板载，减少模型跨卡拆分的通信开销，适配长Prompt处理及多租户并发场景。目前GPU D系列已进入客户送样阶段，具体售价与上市时间尚未公布。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亚马逊开源TorchNeuron工具，实现PyTorch代码在Trainium芯片上无缝运行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c25f1e864b1a596375dec22d63938321.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亚马逊于10月19日正式推出开源工具TorchNeuron，旨在打破英伟达CUDA在AI算力领域的生态垄断。该工具的核心价值在于，开发者无需重写PyTorch代码，仅需修改一处配置参数，即可将模型训练任务迁移至亚马逊自研的Trainium芯片上运行。在圣何塞北美PyTorch大会发布前夕的测试显示，模型在Trainium与传统芯片上的训练逻辑、学习速度及结果保持高度一致，确保了开发者既有调试工具链的兼容性。亚马逊通过参与PyTorch上游开发，致力于推动框架的“硬件无关化”，降低开发者在不同芯片架构间切换的迁移成本。此举不仅为Trainium芯片铺路，更意在通过开源策略松动GPU生态壁垒，为行业提供更具竞争力的算力选择权，加速AI基础设施的多元化进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI紧急启动300亿美元融资，估值目标直指1.4万亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正加速推进新一轮300亿美元融资，旨在竞争对手Anthropic预计于11月中旬IPO前锁定资本，本轮融资后其估值有望达到1.4万亿美元。目前，软银集团、阿布扎比MGX及现有投资方正就此进行深度洽谈。此次融资节奏远超常规周期，核心动机在于抢占顶尖投资群体，并为高额基础设施投入提供资金支持。对于OpenAI而言，充足的现金流不仅能巩固其在LLM领域的领头羊地位，还能在未来资本市场波动时为公司资产负债表提供缓冲。面对两家AI独角兽的密集融资与上市动作，投资机构需在极短时间内完成评估与决策，AI领域的资本博弈已进入白热化阶段。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
